WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.587
Magician: Look into my hat. It is empty.

2
00:00:08.588 --> 00:00:15.000
Now, watch closely. Ricky:

3
00:00:15.001 --> 00:00:19.684
Wow! How did he do that? Magician:

4
00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:24.669
For my next trick, I need a helper.

5
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:29.207
Rachel: Ricky, don't go!

6
00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:31.348
Magician: You. Come here, please.

7
00:00:31.349 --> 00:00:36.443
Ricky: I'll be okay, Rachel.

8
00:00:36.444 --> 00:00:39.430
Magician: What's your name, young man?

9
00:00:39.431 --> 00:00:41.881
Ricky: My name is Ricky.

10
00:00:41.882 --> 00:00:44.248
Magician: Nice to meet you,

11
00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:46.407
Ricky. Can you become invisible?

12
00:00:46.408 --> 00:00:51.153
Ricky: Invisible? No, I can't.

13
00:00:51.154 --> 00:00:56.028
Magician: Stand in the box, please.

14
00:00:56.029 --> 00:01:00.676
Ricky: Umm. Will this hurt?

15
00:01:00.677 --> 00:01:05.885
Magician: It won't hurt a bit.

16
00:01:05.886 --> 00:01:13.413
Abracadabra! Rachel:

17
00:01:13.414 --> 00:01:17.368
Where is my brother? Magician:

18
00:01:17.369 --> 00:01:23.423
Don't worry. He's right here.

19
00:01:23.424 --> 00:01:26.569
Rachel: You scared me, Ricky.

20
00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:37.043
Ricky: Sorry, Rachel. I'm here now. That was really fun!

